%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif","fontSize":"17px","actorBkg":"#edf6f8","actorBorder":"#568896","actorTextColor":"#173344","noteBkgColor":"#f4f6f8","noteBorderColor":"#b0bcc6","signalColor":"#506978"},"sequence":{"mirrorActors":false,"messageMargin":25,"noteMargin":15,"diagramMarginX":15}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as SGLang / 调用方
    participant C as 控制线程
    participant I as 发送线程
    participant W as 原传输 worker
    S->>C: 入队 start_prefetch(完整 token 链)
    C-->>S: handle，尚不表示可用
    Note over C: 查询线程返回候选范围<br/>重查并 pin CPU 已有前缀
    C->>C: 分配 chunk 0，claim 记账
    C->>I: chunk 0 入队
    I->>W: 原 IPC 下发
    par chunk 0 搬运中
        W->>W: REMOTE2H chunk 0
    and 填满 window = 2
        C->>C: 准备 chunk 1，claim 记账
        C->>I: chunk 1 入队
        I->>W: 原 IPC 下发
    end
    W-->>C: chunk 0 完成
    C->>C: 连续发布到 CPU，归还额度
    C->>I: claim 后补入 chunk 2
    Note over C,W: 按此循环补窗口；全部计划已下发时 seal<br/>继续收齐已登记图的完成并发布 / 回收
    W-->>C: 最后一个在途图完成
    C->>C: inflight = 0，发布 terminal snapshot
    S->>C: 观察终态
    C-->>S: 可复用前缀 + 有效结果 lease
    S->>C: held GET 取得 CPU 引用，再 release_prefetch
    Note over S,W: 准入通过后按原 H2D 恢复，计算未命中尾部
